---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { BUSINESS } from '../config/site';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---

<Legal
  title="Terms and conditions"
  metaTitle="Website terms and conditions | Espoir Care"
  description="The terms for using the Espoir Care website, including how to use our forms, our content and links to other websites."
  path="/terms-and-conditions/"
  lead="The rules for using this website."
>
  <h2>About these terms</h2>
  <p>
    This website is run by {BUSINESS.legalName}, trading as Espoir Care (formerly Being Human Care). By using the site, you agree to these terms. If you do
    not agree, please do not use the site.
  </p>
  <p>
    These terms cover the website only. Your support or nursing services are covered by a separate service agreement that we make with you.
  </p>

  <h2>Information on this website</h2>
  <p>
    The information on this site is general. It is not medical, legal or financial advice. It does not replace advice from your doctor, the NDIA, DVA
    or another professional who knows your situation.
  </p>
  <p>
    We try to keep the site accurate and up to date, but funding rules and our services can change. Please check with us before making decisions based on
    what you read here.
  </p>

  <h2>Not an emergency service</h2>
  <p>This website and our forms are not monitored around the clock. In an emergency, call 000.</p>

  <h2>Using our forms</h2>
  <p>When you send a form, please:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>give accurate details</li>
    <li>only share someone else's information if you have their permission</li>
    <li>not send anything unlawful, offensive or harmful</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Our <a href={url('/privacy-policy/')}>privacy policy</a> explains how we handle the information you send.</p>

  <h2>Our content</h2>
  <p>
    The text, logo and design of this website belong to us. You may view, print or share pages for personal, non-commercial use. Please do not copy our
    content or logo for any other purpose without our written permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>
    We link to other websites, such as government sites, that we think may help you. We are not responsible for their content or how they handle your
    information.
  </p>

  <h2>Our responsibility</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing in these terms excludes, restricts or changes any right or remedy you have under the Australian Consumer Law or any other law that cannot be
    excluded. Apart from those rights, and to the extent the law allows, we are not liable for any loss that comes from using this website or relying on
    its general information.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The version on this page is the one that applies.</p>

  <h2>Law that applies</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Queensland, Australia.</p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    Phone: <a href={BUSINESS.phoneHref}>{BUSINESS.phone}</a><br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${BUSINESS.email}`}>{BUSINESS.email}</a><br />
    ABN: {BUSINESS.abn}
  </p>
</Legal>
